From: olgacoltd <346892864+olgacoltd@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 06:03:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] Add Group Layers and Ungroup Layers actions

layers-group-selected puts the selected layers (in stacking order, a layer
whose ancestor group is also selected moves with that group) into a new
layer group at the place of the topmost one. layers-ungroup moves the
children of the selected groups out, in order, and removes the groups.
Both are a single undo step. They have no default key in the source; the
product's default shortcutsrc binds them.
